      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Felid)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can wait out a problem until it becomes a mistake.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Predator Patience.</strong> You have advantage on Perception and Insight checks while hidden or observing quietly. Once per long rest, you may treat a failed attack roll as a hit (describe the perfect timing).</p>",
